  "description": "<p>Display your American spirit proudly with Rothco&rsquo;s Iron On / Sew On Embroidered US Flag Patch. This meticulously crafted patch features impeccable embroidery detailing of the American flag, showcasing top-quality craftsmanship. Constructed with a durable 65% cotton / 35% polyester blend, the American Flag Patch ensures longevity and resilience to wear and tear. Available in both normal and reverse orientations, you have the flexibility to properly display the flag patch according to your preference. Whether you choose to iron it on or sew it on, this US patch offers versatile installation options, allowing you to personalize your uniform attire or tactical gear with ease. Measuring 2 inch x 3 inch, the patch is the perfect size to adorn clothing, backpacks, hats, or gear. Adding this emblem to your collection is a must for any patriot. Whether you're a tactical enthusiast, a uniformed professional, or simply want to show your American spirit, Rothco&rsquo;s Embroidered US Flag Patch is an essential accessory. Make a statement and honor the red, white, and blue with this iconic patch.</p>",
